e, your youth shall never bow to the oppression of reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll grow with them, experience conflicts and beautiful moments together, and every heroine has her own\u00a0relationship rank storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/1_1_\u9752\u6625\u5c31\u662f\u53db\u9006\u4ecb\u7ecd\u9875\u9762.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/2_0_\u60f3\u8c61\u5c31\u662f\u529b\u91cf_en.jpg?t=1746229160\" />Fictional things materialize as [Linker] girls! Over 40 of them! \u2764 Not gacha, not DLC, all included in the base game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each [Linker] has her own relationship rank storyline and CG!! Exclusive cards and passive abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/2_1_\u60f3\u8c61\u5c31\u662f\u529b\u91cf\u4ecb\u7ecd\u9875\u9762_en.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-paced RPG + card battles, use your will! Freely build your deck [Tactics]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/Cards.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards are skills, in a single battle you can command up to 3 Godsouls + 3 Linkers on the battlefield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abundant cards await your collection! There's also [Card Master Mode] for smoother card battles, with keyboard support! (Can be mapped to steamdeck)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, there's also [RPG Mode], where you can see the battle animations~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/5_0_\u4e3b\u8981\u89d2\u8272_en.jpg?t=1746229160\" /><strong>Rebel YOU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Me&quot; (That's you! The Handsome Rebel, you choose your own name~)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boy who loves anime, digital technology, and artificial intelligence. (18 years old)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently working hard to create an AI cat girl...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Interaction is locked to first-person perspective!]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Enthusiast : Kami</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u9762\u5c0f\u795e\u5e38\u670d\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1746229160\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice Actor (CV): Hanser/MiHu<br>age:18</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">flashy action games always get her extremely excited. During the day, she loves to procrastinate and sleep; at night, she rules the gaming world. She aspires to be a game designer, but no one around her has ever supported her. For some unknown reason, she occasionally twirls her twin ponytails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial GodSoul Awakening: Blazing Rose<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u9762\u5c0f\u795e\u521d\u89c9\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vivid Dream Painter: Lincy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">age:18</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice Actor (CV): Cotton candy <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u7075\u6c50\u5e38\u670d\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> cute-style artist. She's as gentle and soft as a bunny and believes that cuteness is justice! Even if she gets caught up in her work, she\u2019ll paint cute girls and lose track of time. When painting, it's as if she enters a dreamlike otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial GodSoul Awakening: Phantasmal Snow Dream<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u9762\u7075\u6c50\u521d\u89c9\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Radio Glitter: Hoshimu(StarDream)<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u9762\u661f\u68a6\u5e38\u670d\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice Actor (CV): Zhi Mao<br>age:19</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A music Creator who came to the City of Dreams to strive on her own. Touched by virtual idols, she's always working hard to learn singing and dancing, hoping to become an idol who conveys dreams one day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial GodSoul Awakening: Thunder Rhythm<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u9762\u661f\u68a6\u521d\u89c9\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cyber Hermit: MoonShadow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice Actor (CV): Ruo Wu<br>age:24</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u9762\u6708\u5f71\u5e38\u670d\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A master's student in University, also a programmer in the company.squeezed by both her mentor and the company as a programmer during the day. Off-hours, she transforms into &quot;Spirit Fox,&quot; navigating the online world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Initial GodSoul Awakening: ??(The current version has not yet joined the team, and will be updated for free in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/7_0_\u4e16\u754c\u89c2_en.jpg?t=1746229160\" />Reality: &quot;Light Cyberpunk&quot; City -REALITY? NOW IS CYBERPUNK-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A peculiarly light cyberpunk city\u2014Dream City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 20X1, giant corporations monopolize the entire city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Virtual reality technology is advanced, AI has replaced countless traditional jobs, holographic advertisements and neon lights line the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds futuristic, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However\u2014the you in this story is trapped in a baggy, flour-sack-like blue-and-white uniform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up punctually at six every morning, take cold showers in a dormitory without hot water,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And still need to queue with paper meal tickets to eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is this the start of school? Is this summer vacation? No one can say for sure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only you know\u2014something is truly off about this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/8_0_\u5f02\u7a7a_en.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5f02\u7a7a2.png?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heterotopias</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special space &quot;Heterotopia&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Godsouls, consciousness, cognition, fictional things materialize in Heterotopia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">According to different perceptions, Heterotopia is diverse, with half-cyberpunk half-mythological battlefields, cosmic spaces, otherworldly realms, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u5e7b\u7075CG11.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They\u2014those Linker girls, are attracted to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What exactly is Heterotopia? We'll need to explore more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*all godsouls/Linkers/enemies are over 18 years old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/9_0_\u6df1\u6e0a\u9b54\u57df_en.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/extras/\u9b54\u57df.jpg?t=1746229160\" /></p>","developers":["U-Secret Studio"],"dlc":[3573830,3573850,3573840,3594420,3586100,3573860,3573870],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213300/header.jpg?t=1746229160","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134142,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134142/movie480.mp4?t=1746169619","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134142/movie_max.mp4?t=1746169619"},"name":"GSEA","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134142/029f5335850fab57334aee7362519d6e0e6e9fee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746169619","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134142/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746169619","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134142/movie_max_vp9.web